aystation.com/en-us/concept/10000649", "external_game_source": {"id": 36, "name": "Playstation Store US"}}], "franchises": [{"id": 151, "name": "Spider-Man"}, {"id": 124, "name": "Marvel"}], "game_modes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Single player"}], "genres": [{"id": 25, "name": "Hack and slash/Beat 'em up"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Adventure"}], "involved_companies": [{"id": 148080, "company": {"id": 10100, "name": "Sony Interactive Entertainment"}, "developer": false}, {"id": 148079, "company": {"id": 834, "name": "Insomniac Games"}, "developer": true}], "name": "Marvel's Spider-Man: Miles Morales", "platforms": [48, 6, 167], "player_perspectives": [{"id": 2, "name": "Third person"}], "rating": 79.65011274820188, "release_dates": [{"id": 210957, "date": 1605139200, "platform": 167, "y": 2020, "release_region": {"id": 5, "region": "japan"}}, {"id": 397020, "date": 1668729600, "platform": 6, "y": 2022, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 210954, "date": 1605139200, "platform": 48, "y": 2020, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 210958, "date": 1605139200, "platform": 167, "y": 2020, "release_region": {"id": 9, "region": "korea"}}, {"id": 210956, "date": 1605139200, "platform": 167, "y": 2020, "release_region": {"id": 4, "region": "new_zealand"}}, {"id": 210959, "date": 1605744000, "platform": 167, "y": 2020, "release_region": {"id": 1, "region": "europe"}}, {"id": 210960, "date": 1605744000, "platform": 167, "y": 2020, "release_region": {"id": 6, "region": "china"}}, {"id": 210953, "date": 1605139200, "platform": 167, "y": 2020, "release_region": {"id": 2, "region": "north_america"}}, {"id": 210955, "date": 1605139200, "platform": 167, "y": 2020, "release_region": {"id": 3, "region": "australia"}}, {"id": 210961, "date": 1605744000, "platform": 167, "y": 2020, "release_region": {"id": 7, "region": "asia"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 388179, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8bir.jpg"}, {"id": 388180, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8bis.jpg"}, {"id": 1380645, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sctlb9.jpg"}], "slug": "marvels-spider-man-miles-morales", "storyline": "A year after gaining spider-like abilities, Miles Morales has been training under Peter Parker and is settling into his new home in Harlem with his mother Rio. When Peter leaves New York to assist Mary Jane Watson overseas, Miles becomes the city's sole Spider-Man. Almost immediately, a violent conflict erupts between the Roxxon Energy Corporation, which is pushing a new experimental energy source called Nuform, and a high-tech criminal army known as the Underground.\n\nThe Underground is led by a masked figure called the Tinkerer, whose identity hits close to home for Miles. As the fighting threatens to consume Harlem, Miles must navigate the responsibilities of protecting his community, supporting his mother's city council campaign, and uncovering the truth behind Roxxon's new technology and the real motives driving the Underground's war.", "summary": "Marvel's Spider-Man: Miles Morales is a third-person action-adventure game and a standalone continuation of Marvel's Spider-Man (2018). Set in an open-world version of New York City during winter, the game follows Miles Morales as he takes on the role of Spider-Man while Peter Parker is abroad. Gameplay focuses on traversal, combat, and completing missions across the city. Miles has unique abilities distinct from Peter, including bio-electric \"Venom\" attacks and temporary invisibility. The game features unlockable suits, gadgets, and a skill tree progression system.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/marvels-spider-man-miles-morales", "videos": [{"id": 40714, "name": "Gameplay Demo", "video_id": "T03PxxuCfDA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T03PxxuCfDA", "title": "Marvel\u2019s Spider-Man: Miles Morales - Gameplay Demo | PS5", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/T03PxxuCfDA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 75338, "name": "PC Trailer", "video_id": "D3wEP8kJ6Vo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D3wEP8kJ6Vo", "title": "Marvel's Spider-Man: Miles Morales - Teaser Trailer | PC Games", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/D3wEP8kJ6Vo/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 7292, "name": "Marvel's Spider-Man"}]}